{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c54d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a824-3367-71b3-b578-b3dbe0e13bbe"},"sequence":257,"recorded_at":1780531400000509,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"70aff3fa-2b06-43ab-b4a6-dd81d1872e01","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"70aff3fa-2b06-43ab-b4a6-dd81d1872e01","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"70aff3fa-2b06-43ab-b4a6-dd81d1872e01"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a824-cf9e-7731-9566-9892d4f63834"},"task_id":"01a0a824-cf9e-7731-9566-9892d4f63834","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a824-cf9e-7731-9566-9892d4f63834","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-5-1\",\n  \"command\": \"task-board m 'get(TASK-260916-2vzsmy) { id name status checklist notes outcomeResources description ac }' 2>&1\\necho \\\"---STORY---\\\"\\ntask-board m 'get(STORY-260916-1o0gkc) { id name status checklist notes outcomeResources description }' 2>&1\",\n  \"description\": \"Read task and story details\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\\"ac\\\":\\\"Release scripts and preflight are validated and documented, metadata tests pass, candidate ready for review and integration so the subsequent release tag uses the repaired workflow.\\\",\\\"checklist\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implement the complete scoped production behavior and acceptance criteria\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Run relevant tests and record concrete results and remaining bounds\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Attach task-prefixed outcome evidence and hand off for independent review\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"In a managed Story worktree the candidate is left UNCOMMITTED in the worktree for the handoff to snapshot — never commit on the Story branch. A producer commit moves the branch tip off the recorded checkpoint and the handoff refuses with change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint; repair with `git reset --soft \\\\u003ccheckpoint_oid\\\\u003e` before completing again.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lint clean\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\",\\\"done\\\":false}],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Validate repaired release automation, preflight and source documentation after the CI fix checkpoint. Exercise release metadata and packaging gates with focused tests; document exact signing/notarization and Sparkle requirements. This leaf prepares the release machinery for integration; do not tag or publish yet. Final release is a separate delivery Story after both code Stories land. Use Muse Spark max. No UI tests, no production runner interruption, no secret output, no manual Story commits.\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260916-2vzsmy\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"release-preflight-and-documentation\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"spawn selection rationale tuple: {\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"developer\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pair\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"muse-spark-1.3-contributor/max\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"User-selected Muse Spark max; release preflight and documentation after accepted signing fixes checkpointed, no publication yet.\\\\\\\"}\\\\nspawn selection rationale for muse-spark-1.3-contributor/max: User-selected Muse Spark max; release preflight and documentation after accepted signing fixes checkpointed, no publication yet.\\\\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: muse via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[muse,codex,claude], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\\\\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260916-07794b, max_parallel=3)\\\\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260916-07794b)\\\",\\\"outcomeResources\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"TASK-260916-2vzsmy_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260916-07794b.log\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260916-2vzsmy/TASK-260916-2vzsmy_spawn-log_-implementer--developer--muse-_RUN-260916-07794b.log\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"System spawn log captured by task-board\\\"}],\\\"status\\\":\\\"development\\\"}\\n---STORY---\\n{\\\"checklist\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Repair release automation and deliver the accepted application as a public GitHub release.\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"STORY-260916-1o0gkc\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"signed-notarized-release\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"outcomeResources\\\":[],\\\"status\\\":\\\"development\\\"}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4430,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1108,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
